  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.1:\n- Deprecation notes\nv1.7.0:\n- BusinessRegistryBusiness.OwnerKey: key of the business that directly owns it\n- BusinessRegistryAPI.GetOwnedBusinesses (direct or whole hierarchy) and GetOwners (owner chain up to the root)\nv1.6.0:\n- Use of GetFieldsForSigning\n- NotifyMediaReadyVideo reads the webhook's bare HTTP status (2xx delivered; 400, 401 or 403 rejected)\nv1.4.0:\n- JTigerNovaMediaCatalog.NotifyMediaReadyVideo\nv1.3.0:\n- JTigerNovaMediaCatalog: app key constructor overload, NotifyMediaReadyVideo (the media server's media-ready webhook)\nv1.2.0:\n- Fix for API test path\nv1.1.0:\n- GetSeeds()\nv1.0.0:\n- BaseApi: RestSharp client base with a uniform ApiResult<T> envelope\n- BusinessRegistryAPI: business registry client over jtiger.network's resilient client",
